<%# 전교 통합 통계(P7.5). 전 학교 참여율·5축 평균 + 전국 랭킹 원자료. %>
<div class="space-y-6">
  <div class="page-header">
    <h1 class="page-title">전교 통합 통계</h1>
    <div class="page-actions">
      <%= link_to "전교 CSV 내보내기", admin_analytics_export_path(format: :csv), class: "btn btn-primary" %>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3">
    <div class="stat-card">
      <p class="stat-card__label">전체 학생</p>
      <p class="stat-card__value"><%= @total_students %></p>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-card">
      <p class="stat-card__label">전체 독후감</p>
      <p class="stat-card__value"><%= @total_reports %></p>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-card">
      <p class="stat-card__label">승인(검토완료)</p>
      <p class="stat-card__value"><%= @approved_count %></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="card">
    <h2 class="mb-3 text-base font-semibold text-ink">학교별 통계</h2>
    <div class="overflow-x-auto">
      <table class="w-full text-left text-sm">
        <thead class="border-b border-hairline text-steel">
          <tr>
            <th class="py-2 pr-4">학교</th>
            <th class="py-2 pr-4">학생수</th>
            <th class="py-2 pr-4">독후감수</th>
            <th class="py-2 pr-4">참여율(%)</th>
            <% ReadingDomain::RUBRIC_AXES.each do |axis| %>
              <th class="py-2 pr-4"><%= ReadingDomain::AXIS_LABELS[axis] %></th>
            <% end %>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <% @school_stats.each do |stat| %>
            <tr class="border-b border-hairline-soft">
              <td class="py-2 pr-4 font-medium text-ink"><%= stat[:school].name %></td>
              <td class="py-2 pr-4 text-slate"><%= stat[:student_count] %></td>
              <td class="py-2 pr-4 text-slate"><%= stat[:report_count] %></td>
              <td class="py-2 pr-4 text-slate"><%= stat[:participation] %></td>
              <% ReadingDomain::RUBRIC_AXES.each do |axis| %>
                <td class="py-2 pr-4 text-slate"><%= stat[:axis_averages][axis] %></td>
              <% end %>
            </tr>
          <% end %>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="card">
    <h2 class="mb-3 text-base font-semibold text-ink">전국 랭킹 원자료 (포인트 상위)</h2>
    <% if @ranking.empty? %>
      <p class="text-sm text-steel">아직 랭킹 데이터가 없어요.</p>
    <% else %>
      <ol class="space-y-1 text-sm">
        <% @ranking.each_with_index do |user, index| %>
          <li class="flex justify-between">
            <span class="text-ink"><%= index + 1 %>. <%= user.name %> (<%= user.school&.name %>)</span>
            <span class="text-right">
              <span class="block font-medium text-ink"><%= user.points %>P</span>
              <span class="block text-xs text-steel"><%= user.experience %>XP · Lv.<%= user.trainer_level %></span>
            </span>
          </li>
        <% end %>
      </ol>
    <% end %>
  </section>
</div>
